{
  "version": 1,
  "today": "2026-10-07",
  "default_currency": {
    "pl": "PLN",
    "en": "USD"
  },
  "rules": [
    "Extract only facts present in the text or the explicit request context. Never infer recurrence from the name of a bill or service.",
    "A past-tense payment without an explicit date does not mean today. Today is resolved only when the person says today.",
    "Dates remain partial: preserve stated day, month and year. Calendar calculations and choosing the first full date belong to server code.",
    "A non-monthly interval needs an anchor month. A quarterly bill due on the 15th still needs clarification about the first payment.",
    "Missing contains every required unknown field, not just the first follow-up question. Its order is irrelevant.",
    "The request supplies default_currency explicitly. Language alone does not determine currency in the application.",
    "A proposal never authorizes a write, even when missing is empty. The person must confirm the complete resolved entry.",
    "Question results classify the question only. Totals and dates must come from authenticated backend queries.",
    "duration_months is not a number of payments and does not imply a monthly interval.",
    "Only explicitly listed name and category alternatives are accepted. Numeric values and date parts must match exactly."
  ],
